# FlowTree — Cards — módulo `tasks`

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@projectUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_PROJETO
@cardUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_CARD
@columnUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_COLUNA
@sprintUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_SPRINT
@assigneeUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_RESPONSAVEL
@flagUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_FLAG

### Listar cards do projeto
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/cards
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar cards com filtros (coluna, sprint, responsável, prioridade, flag, busca)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/cards?column={{columnUuid}}&sprint=backlog&assignee={{assigneeUuid}}&priority=high&flag={{flagUuid}}&search=login
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar card no Backlog
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/cards
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Revisar documento do projeto",
  "description": "Conferir o escopo e os prazos com o cliente.",
  "board_column_uuid": "{{columnUuid}}",
  "priority": "medium",
  "due_date": "2026-09-18"
}

### Criar card completo (sprint, responsável, flags)
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/cards
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Corrigir login no mobile",
  "description": "Botão de login não responde em telas pequenas.",
  "board_column_uuid": "{{columnUuid}}",
  "sprint_uuid": "{{sprintUuid}}",
  "assignee_uuid": "{{assigneeUuid}}",
  "priority": "urgent",
  "due_date": "2026-09-10",
  "flag_uuids": ["{{flagUuid}}"]
}

### Detalhar card (comentários, anexos, movimentos)
GET {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar card (campos opcionais)
PUT {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Corrigir login no mobile (iOS)",
  "priority": "high",
  "due_date": "2026-09-12",
  "assignee_uuid": "{{assigneeUuid}}",
  "flag_uuids": ["{{flagUuid}}"]
}

### Trocar só a prioridade (popover do card)
PUT {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "priority": "low"
}

### Mandar o card para o Backlog e tirar o responsável
PUT {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sprint_uuid": null,
  "assignee_uuid": null
}

### Mover card (mesma sprint, outra coluna, topo)
PATCH {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "board_column_uuid": "{{columnUuid}}",
  "position": 0
}

### Mover card para outra sprint (raia) e coluna
PATCH {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "board_column_uuid": "{{columnUuid}}",
  "sprint_uuid": "{{sprintUuid}}",
  "position": 1
}

### Mover card para o Backlog
PATCH {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "board_column_uuid": "{{columnUuid}}",
  "sprint_uuid": null,
  "position": 0
}

### Excluir card
DELETE {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
